  - evidence: seen lines: +3 newly resolved (3 distinct wordings), 0 wrong, 0 lost; unseen lines: +2 newly resolved (2 distinct wordings), 0 wrong, 0 lost; e.g. « BLUETOOTH AIRPODS LENOVO XT92/XT83 » → BL-TOOTH AIRPODS LENOVO XT92/XT83; « HEADSET BLUETOOTH BROROFONE BO11 » → CASQUE BL-TOOTH BROROFONE BO11; « SPEAKER BLUETOOTH HOCO BS33 » → BAFFLE BL-TOOTH HOCO BS33
