## Calibrations

- **calibration after 30 invoices** (403 seen + 135 unseen lines): 263/403 right with no AI (65 %), 1 wrong → 327/403 right with no AI (81 %), 1 wrong; accepted 14, rejected 27; search: BM25 (brand ×2) + 0.5·trigrams: right product in the top 8 for 91.6 % of lines (MRR 0.91) → BM25: 91.8 % in the top 8 (MRR 0.92); engineer rules []; $0.2424. Spark: suppliers use english generic words while catalogue uses french, plus T-C/TYPE-C/USB-C and generation synonyms, storage-only lines need fuzzy search
- **calibration after 60 invoices** (825 seen + 275 unseen lines): 677/825 right with no AI (82 %), 1 wrong → 684/825 right with no AI (83 %), 1 wrong; accepted 2, rejected 7; search: BM25: right product in the top 8 for 92.4 % of lines (MRR 0.92) → BM25: 92.6 % in the top 8 (MRR 0.92); engineer rules []; $0.2278. Spark: glass/flash/baffle/pochette synonyms plus eme/th generation plus memory-off for storage-only phone/laptop lines
- **calibration after 90 invoices** (1229 seen + 410 unseen lines): 1020/1229 right with no AI (83 %), 1 wrong → 1045/1229 right with no AI (85 %), 1 wrong; accepted 2, rejected 2; search: BM25: right product in the top 8 for 93.0 % of lines (MRR 0.93) → BM25 + 0.5·word similarity: 93.0 % in the top 8 (MRR 0.93); engineer rules []; $0.1799. Spark: screen protectors, USB keys, speakers and cases use different words than catalogue; generations and portable/pc also block exact match
- **calibration after 120 invoices** (1646 seen + 549 unseen lines): 1400/1646 right with no AI (85 %), 1 wrong → 1400/1646 right with no AI (85 %), 1 wrong; accepted 0, rejected 3; search: BM25 + 0.5·word similarity: right product in the top 8 for 93.6 % of lines (MRR 0.93) → BM25 + 0.5·word similarity: 93.6 % in the top 8 (MRR 0.93); engineer rules []; $0.1808. Spark: Glass/screen, USB flash, speaker and laptop synonyms plus generation and connector variants block auto-match; storage-only phone lines need fuzzy search.

